arguments.prompt:
## Context

A Blazor Web App has been scaffolded at `/tmp/sv-368f737473094b8f95c0777ab3d28eaa/ShipmentTracker/` using `dotnet new blazor -int Auto -ai -au Individual`. This creates:

- **ShipmentTracker** (server project) at `/tmp/sv-368f737473094b8f95c0777ab3d28eaa/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/`
- **ShipmentTracker.Client** (WebAssembly client project) at `/tmp/sv-368f737473094b8f95c0777ab3d28eaa/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/`

This is an Interactive Auto Global setup. All interactive components MUST go in the `.Client` project. Data access from interactive components must go through HTTP APIs (no direct DbContext access from `.Client`).

## Task

Implement a logistics shipment tracking application with these features:

1. **Dispatchers** view a list of shipments with status and destination
2. **Customers** check their shipment status and estimated delivery
3. Authentication with individual accounts (already scaffolded)

## Implementation Plan

### 1. Shared Models in `.Client` project

Create `/tmp/sv-368f737473094b8f95c0777ab3d28eaa/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Models/ShipmentDto.cs`:

```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public class ShipmentDto
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Status { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public DateTime ShippedDate { get; set; }
    public DateTime EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public DateTime? ActualDelivery { get; set; }
    public string RecipientName { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string CarrierName { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public double WeightKg { get; set; }
}

public class ShipmentStatusUpdate
{
    public int ShipmentId { get; set; }
    public string NewStatus { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}
```

### 2. Service Interface in `.Client` project

Create `/tmp/sv-368f737473094b8f95c0777ab3d28eaa/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/IShipmentService.cs`:

```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public interface IShipmentService
{
    Task<List<ShipmentDto>> GetAllShipmentsAsync();
    Task<ShipmentDto?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber);
    Task UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(ShipmentStatusUpdate update);
}
```

### 3. Client Implementation (HttpClient-based)

Create `/tmp/sv-368f737473094b8f95c0777ab3d28eaa/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/ClientShipmentService.cs`:

```csharp
using System.Net.Http.Json;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public class ClientShipmentService(HttpClient http) : IShipmentService
{
    public async Task<List<ShipmentDto>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<ShipmentDto>>("api/shipments") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<ShipmentDto?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        try
        {
            return await http.GetFromJsonAsync<ShipmentDto>($"api/shipments/track/{trackingNumber}");
        }
        catch (HttpRequestException ex) when (ex.StatusCode == System.Net.HttpStatusCode.NotFound)
        {
            return null;
        }
    }

    public async Task UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(ShipmentStatusUpdate update)
    {
        await http.PostAsJsonAsync("api/shipments/update-status", update);
    }
}
```

### 4. Server Entity and DbContext Update

Create `/tmp/sv-368f737473094b8f95c0777ab3d28eaa/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Data/Shipment.cs`:

```csharp
using System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Data;

public class Shipment
{
    public int Id { get; set; }

    [Required, MaxLength(50)]
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [Required, MaxLength(200)]
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [Required, MaxLength(200)]
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [Required, MaxLength(50)]
    public string Status { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    public DateTime ShippedDate { get; set; }
    public DateTime EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public DateTime? ActualDelivery { get; set; }

    [Required, MaxLength(200)]
    public string RecipientName { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [Required, MaxLength(100)]
    public string CarrierName { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    public double WeightKg { get; set; }
}
```

Edit `/tmp/sv-368f737473094b8f95c0777ab3d28eaa/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Data/ApplicationDbContext.cs` to add the Shipments DbSet:

```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Identity.EntityFrameworkCore;
using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Data;

